  "display_title": "Syrinx, the Villain Healer",
  "description": "Syrinx Aden has long been eluding the pursuers who murdered her family. All she wants now is to lay low while working as a jeweler, but she keeps attracting unwanted patients due to her ability to heal people with gems. Unfortunately, her newest patient turns out to be Heimdal, a notorious villain with a split personality. Despite her efforts to stay away, she somehow runs into him at every turn. Will Syrinx be able to escape Heimdal before danger catches up with her, or is it already too late? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
